---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ContactBand from "../components/ContactBand.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="How Rachel Archer Counselling looks after your details when you get in touch by phone, email, or the contact form."
>
	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="lead page-lead">
				The short version: when you get in touch, I use your details only to reply
				to you. I never sell, share, or pass them on.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="prose">
				<p>Last updated: August 2026.</p>

				<h2>What I collect</h2>
				<p>
					If you use the contact form, I receive the details you choose to send:
					your name, email address, phone number (optional), your message, and how
					you&rsquo;d prefer me to contact you. When you submit the form, your
					message is composed in your own email app and sent from your own email
					account to {site.email}. This website itself never stores your message.
				</p>
				<p>
					If you contact me directly by phone or email, I only keep what you choose
					to tell me.
				</p>

				<h2>How I use your details</h2>
				<p>
					I use the details you give me only to reply to your enquiry and, if we go
					on to work together, to arrange appointments and keep the notes that good
					counselling practice requires. I keep your details for no purpose other
					than this.
				</p>

				<h2>How long I keep them</h2>
				<p>
					Enquiry emails are kept until the matter is resolved, then deleted. If we
					work together, I keep counselling records in line with the BACP&rsquo;s
					guidance on record-keeping. You can ask me to delete anything I hold at
					any time, and I will, unless I have an ethical or legal duty to keep it.
				</p>

				<h2>Who I share them with</h2>
				<p>
					No one. I don&rsquo;t sell data, rent it, or pass it on. This website is
					a simple, static site: it uses no cookies, no analytics, and no tracking.
				</p>

				<h2>Your rights</h2>
				<p>
					You have the right to see what information I hold about you, to ask me to
					correct or delete it, and to complain to the Information
					Commissioner&rsquo;s Office (ICO) if you feel I&rsquo;ve handled your data
					incorrectly. To exercise any of these rights, just ask me.
				</p>

				<h2>Contact</h2>
				<p>
					For anything to do with your personal data, contact Rachel Archer by
					phone on <a href={`tel:${site.phoneTel}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a> or
					email at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<ContactBand />
</BaseLayout>
